  "brief": {
    "zh": "找回东、西、南、北四份散落的航图，在风暴眼集合。三台风暴信标在第 8、18、32 回合各震一次，只影响当回合的本格和相邻四格。内环有两台巡车，靠外环的风道每 4 回合有一次横向脉冲。限 90 回合。",
    "en": "Recover the four chart fragments from the cardinal points and rendezvous in the storm eye. Three storm beacons pulse on turns 8, 18 and 32. Each pulse affects its own square and its four neighbors for that turn. Two trolleys patrol the inner ring, and a duct by the outer ring pulses sideways every 4 turns. You have 90 turns."
  },
